47
00:03:20,821 --> 00:03:23,040
Back at mission control in Houston,

48
00:03:23,041 --> 00:03:27,100
Apollo 13 is in the capable hands of flight director Gene Kranz.

49
00:03:29,740 --> 00:03:32,060
The square-jawed ex-Korean war aviator

50
00:03:32,061 --> 00:03:37,740
is known for his unshakable sense of organization and command.

51
00:03:37,741 --> 00:03:40,460
The flight director's job description is incredibly simple.

52
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:46,680
It says, the flight director may take any action needed for crew safety and mission success.

53
00:03:49,620 --> 00:03:53,180
Early in the mission, Kranz faced several minor glitches.

54
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:58,840
An engine failure in the second stage booster raised concerns about the fuel supply.

55
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:07,360
