58
00:04:15,340 --> 00:04:18,420
had never had the measles before and therefore was not immune.

59
00:04:18,940 --> 00:04:22,700
When you've worked on something, it's been your goal for many years,

60
00:04:22,701 --> 00:04:26,380
and you've worked on this particular flight for over a year,

61
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:29,480
and there isn't a long line of repeat opportunities.

62
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,640
I had a good case of feeling sorry for myself.

63
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:34,100
I didn't want to lose them, and I argued with the doctors,

64
00:04:34,101 --> 00:04:38,640
