67
00:04:47,700 --> 00:04:50,760
Superbly trained for the job, Swigert fit in well.

68
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:55,660
Two hours, 41 minutes, and 47 seconds after launch,

69
00:04:56,100 --> 00:05:01,880
