94
00:07:21,221 --> 00:07:29,840
16 seconds after Swigert flipped the fan switch, an explosive bang and shudder rocked Apollo 13.

95
00:07:35,320 --> 00:07:40,140
We had a pretty large bang associated with the caution and warning.

96
00:07:40,500 --> 00:07:45,700
Lights coming on, noise all over, jets trying to fire to stabilize the spacecraft.

97
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:48,120
We didn't know what happened.

98
00:07:48,121 --> 00:08:00,754
Don't ever consider it because if you even let that move in the smallest fashion into your mind, you're going to start compromising the direction you need to make the

