120
00:09:50,900 --> 00:09:52,900
We had never ever simulated a case like this,

121
00:09:52,901 --> 00:09:56,900
a case like this because you don't simulate up to a quadruple failure.

122
00:09:56,901 --> 00:10:01,900
You may simulate a double failure, but not this kind of cascading quadruple failure because

123
00:10:01,901 --> 00:10:06,900
