142
00:11:14,601 --> 00:11:18,300
And this was the final piece of information that said,

143
00:11:18,301 --> 00:11:23,380
hey, we had an explosion on board the spacecraft with a lot of collateral damage,

144
00:11:23,880 --> 00:11:26,840
and now this is not a mission that's going to go to the moon.

145
00:11:26,940 --> 00:11:29,300
This is a mission of survival.

146
00:11:29,520 --> 00:11:33,600
And it was that time when I looked into the eyes of the Tiger and said,

147
00:11:33,940 --> 00:11:36,720
