In 1967, during the first Apollo mission, an explosive fire instantly killed all three men aboard.

157
00:12:29,020 --> 00:12:34,740
Virgil Gus Grissom, Edward White, and Roger Taffey lost their lives on the launch pad

158
00:12:34,741 --> 00:12:37,260
