159
00:12:37,261 --> 00:12:40,780
and spread rapidly in the concentrated oxygen environment.

160
00:12:44,220 --> 00:12:48,940
In January of 1967, we had the horrendous Apollo 1 fire,

161
00:12:49,060 --> 00:12:53,520
and I think it was a prime year to demonstrate what happens

162
00:12:53,521 --> 00:12:58,640
when you push for a goal so hard that you become blind

163
00:12:58,641 --> 00:13:02,120
