210
00:16:54,661 --> 00:16:57,440
I keep counting to the crew, there's three of us.

211
00:16:59,680 --> 00:17:03,200
Two days, nine hours, 37 minutes into the mission,

212
00:17:03,800 --> 00:17:07,080
